<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR WORK, YOUR PACE</view><view class="title">设置我的薪情</view><view class="muted">设置一次，每个工作日都能看到小收获。</view><view class="card form-card"><view class="field-label">工资计算方式</view><view class="periods"><button wx:for="{{periods}}" wx:key="id" class="{{form.period === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onPeriod">{{item.name}}</button></view><view class="field-label">工资金额（人民币）</view><view class="amount"><text>¥</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.amount}}" data-field="amount" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="14" placeholder="例如 15000" /></view><view class="fields"><view><view class="field-label">上班时间</view><picker mode="time" value="{{form.start}}" data-field="start" bindchange="onInput"><view class="input">{{form.start}}　⌄</view></picker></view><view><view class="field-label">下班时间</view><picker mode="time" value="{{form.end}}" data-field="end" bindchange="onInput"><view class="input">{{form.end}}　⌄</view></picker></view></view><view class="hint time-hint">下班早于上班时，按跨午夜班次计算。</view><view class="field-label">每周工作日</view><view class="days"><button wx:for="{{dayOptions}}" wx:key="id" class="{{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-day="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onDay">{{item.name}}</button></view><view class="field-label">每月发薪日</view><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.payday}}" data-field="payday" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="2" placeholder="1 到 31，短月自动取月末" /><view class="hint time-hint">只作倒计时，不自动顺延节假日。</view><view class="switch-row"><text>休息时间不计薪</text><switch color="#739458" checked="{{form.breakEnabled}}" bindchange="onBreak" /></view><view wx:if="{{form.breakEnabled}}" class="fields"><view><view class="field-label">休息开始</view><picker mode="time" value="{{form.breakStart}}" data-field="breakStart" bindchange="onInput"><view class="input">{{form.breakStart}}　⌄</view></picker></view><view><view class="field-label">休息结束</view><picker mode="time" value="{{form.breakEnd}}" data-field="breakEnd" bindchange="onInput"><view class="input">{{form.breakEnd}}　⌄</view></picker></view></view><view class="switch-row"><text>收入里程碑提示</text><switch color="#739458" checked="{{milestones}}" bindchange="onMilestones" /></view><view class="hint">仅在小程序打开时提示，不在后台推送消息。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary save" bindtap="onSave">开启我的收入计时 →</button></view><view class="backup"><button class="secondary" bindtap="onExport">导出备份 ↗</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="onImport">导入备份 ↙</button></view><view class="hint backup-hint">导入文件可先发送给文件传输助手，再从聊天文件选择。网页版与桌面版的备份也能导入。</view><button class="text-button privacy" bindtap="showPrivacy">⌑ 工资仅保存在本机 · 查看隐私说明</button></view>
